    "rtgs": "khua kham khu mueang",
    "said": "Every way into the square that is not a gate is a small bridge, and there are more of them than gates.",
    "said_th": "ทุกทางเข้าเวียงตี้บ่ใช่ปะตู๋คือขัวน้อย และมีมากกว่าปะตู๋"
   },
